@startuml flow-read
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
title Normal read: see current rates

participant "Mobile app" as App
participant "Wireless link" as Net
participant "Web service" as API
database "Database" as DB
box "outside our system" #White
participant "NBP API" as NBP
end box

App -> Net : GET /rates
Net -> API : GET /rates
API -> DB : latest saved rates
alt saved rates are from the newest NBP day
  DB --> API : rates + date
else saved rates are old
  API -> NBP : GET table A
  NBP --> API : rates + date
  API -> DB : save copy
end
API --> Net : rates + date
Net --> App : rates + date
App -> App : save to cache, show with date
note over App : no connection or timeout:\nshow cached rates with\n"cached" label
@enduml
